      "text": "[6:28AM] #LagAbkExpWay\n#TrafficUpdate\n\n   The stretch of Ajegunle , Alakuko, Casso, Adura down to Meiran is looking very good, while ijaye is a bit slow due to pedestrian crossing but our officials are on ground.\n\nAbule egba connecting \n Charity corridor,  Abattoir and social Club is looking appreciable at the moment.\n \n Super,Ilepo, Pleasure and the BRT corridor looks good.\n  \n #FollowLASTMA",
